{"id":5168030157,"name":"Frontlines: Pacific","desc":"Frontlines: Pacific is a WWII first-person shooter set in the Pacific Theater. Fight across historic battlefields, recreated at 1:1 scale, with realistic firearms, uniforms, flamethrowers, and tanks.\n⚔️ 50+ weapons\n👨🏻‍✈️ 60+ uniform items\n🌏 5 massive maps from Peleliu to Manila in the Philippines\n⏳ 2 game modes + immersive rainstorms and nighttime battles\n\nThe original Frontlines, in development since 2017—finally released in beta in 2025!\n\n💰 Join our group!\nEarn 20% more credits and unlock the M1 Carbine:\nwww.roblox.com/groups/6335035\n\n💡 Found a bug? Press F9 to open the developer console, screenshot the issue, and report it to the dev team!\n❓ Learn the controls in the in-game help menu.\n💬 Join the community and support development using the links below!\n👍 Thanks for your patience while the game is in beta! Leave a like and turn on notifications to follow our frequent updates.","path":"/game/5168030157-frontlines-pacific","slug":"5168030157-frontlines-pacific","thumbnail":["https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6609600e03e500c9b690d7d02f19d84d/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-635158369eee06c516064830a687a1f0/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter","/brand/kocakz-logo.png"],"playing":22,"visitor":2199084,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-03-16T15:16:34.657Z","creator":{"name":"Frontlines Development","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":1,"freeCount":1,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0},"page":1,"next":null,"total":1,"scripts":[{"slug":"Frontlines:-Pacific-2x-Credits-esp-135896","_id":"69b81ed29994db35198eed0a","title":"esp","game":{"_id":"69b81ed29994db35198eed05","gameId":5168030157,"name":"Frontlines: Pacific","imageUrl":"/images/sb/rbx-635158369eee06c516064830a687a1f0-1761cfd3915e.png","placeId":5168030157},"features":"esp box","tags":["esp"],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://rscripts.net/raw/frontlines-pacific-esp_1773672769288_w1g5AoOoOP.txt\",true))()","owner":{"_id":"68be7bd9cde1e8